<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Harbor Storage</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#091827;color:#dbeafe;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:56px 24px}h1{font-size:42px;margin:0}p{color:#93a4b8}.panel{margin-top:36px;padding:28px;background:#10263a;border:1px solid #24445f;border-radius:12px}code{color:#67e8f9}button{background:#2563eb;color:white;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:10px 14px}</style></head><body><main><p>Harbor Storage</p><h1>Private object storage,<br>under your control.</h1><section class="panel"><h2>Storage API is ready</h2><p>Use path-style S3 requests at <code>/s3/{bucket}/{key}</code>. Create a bucket with a PUT request, then upload objects.</p><button onclick="location.reload()">Refresh status</button></section></main></body></html>
